      "notes": [
        "Verified: go build/vet/test pass on HEAD for internal/action, internal/analyzer, internal/proxy; the two new action tests (TestAssessImpactDeletePodOwnedThroughOwnerReferences, TestAssessImpactDrainSeparatesDaemonSetFromStatefulSet) FAIL when internal/action/impact.go is swapped for the main version, so they exercise the fix. Working tree restored afterwards (git status clean).",
