        "internal/action/impact.go:87-88 comment still says 'podControllerOwned reads labels' although it now reads ownerReferences first; stale wording only, the !observed guard is still correct.",
        "Pre-existing, not introduced here: drain preview counts static/mirror Pods (owner kind Node) as evicted although kubectl drain skips them; could be excluded in the same loop as DaemonSet.",
        "Scope is tight: no refactors, deps, or formatting churn beyond the fix. No auth/migration/secret changes; fully revertible."
